Representation & centralized & federated IID & federated non-IID & retention \\
\midrule
ECGFounder   & 0.885 & 0.885 & 0.612 & 0.69 \\
hand-crafted & 0.644 & 0.643 & 0.591 & \textbf{0.92} \\
HuBERT-ECG   & 0.174 & 0.172 & 0.106 & 0.61 \\
